OL,3,GNEWSAHope boxes aim to ease baby
OL,4,Aseparation trauma
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme that aims to reduce the trauma
OL,7,Fassociated with mums being separated
OL,8,Ffrom their child at birth is being
OL,9,Flaunched in Hertfordshire.
OL,11,FFrom next month, midwives at Watford
OL,12,FGeneral Hospital will hand out Hope
OL,13,FBoxes, containing keepsakes.
OL,15,FHertfordshire County Council, which is
OL,16,Ffunding the scheme, said about 30
OL,17,Fmothers in the county were separated
OL,18,Ffrom their babies at birth last year.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
