OL,3,GNEWSAHope boxes aim to ease baby
OL,4,Aseparation trauma
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela Frazer-Wicks, who had two sons
OL,7,Ftaken into care in 2004, said: "For me,
OL,8,Fthe Hope Boxes really matter because I
OL,9,Fknow exactly how it feels to be left
OL,10,Fwith very little to remember my baby."
